# Bench display bus stress (README "Bench: display bus stress"), layered on sdkconfig.defaults:
#   LCDRACE=1 scripts/flash.sh   (builds build-lcdrace/ with its own sdkconfig, flashes, captures)
# NOT for the clip: a task re-sends tiny rectangles of the picture as fast as it can.
CONFIG_PIXELCLIP_BENCH_LCD_RACE=y
